      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUTSIDETHESQUARE (7) is a former Victorian who made a winning debut for the new yard with a mile win here last week. Same weight, drawn well and surely better for it. Lightly raced and doubt we've seen the ceiling yet. HENLEY EXTREME (2) is an honest type freshened for this. Winner at Hobart two back then placed there last time. Drawn to go close again. Hard to believe SIR JAG (1) has won just one race here from 26 starts. Was a winner five back and placed all four since so is trying hard and should be in the mix again. REGAL HUNTER (4) has been freshened since winning over 2100m last time when leading throughout. Well back in trip but can feature on best form.",
